    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/839f6d83af0307758884f45d18052df3.avif?t=1749718499\" data-has-big width=800 height=6452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/aadc5f3e1db62280a64fef649a4d96c1.webp?t=1749718499\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Irene Lindbergh, a young writer disowned by her own family.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your father, once the most prominent businessman in London, died in a tragic accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, under a torrential rain, the heirs of the family gather at the estate, each with their eyes on the vast inheritance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/5f7641d7f786c7b2375ff32c5cd8d34b.webp?t=1749718499\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutting words and old grudges wound you deeply as you navigate the toxic web of family ties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Was it the pain that ran too deep? Or merely a mistake? <br>In a moment you can\u2019t take back, you commit a murder <br>\u2014though, perhaps\u2026 it wasn\u2019t so accidental after all.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/c50adc44085d01c17d9af6e00d9c1860.webp?t=1749718499\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The detective leans in, his voice low and heavy with suspicion. <br>He speaks as if unveiling a secret he almost doesn\u2019t want to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Someone must have done it,&quot;</i> he says. <br><i>&quot;But only one person could not have.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And as the silence settles like fog over the room, <br>you realize\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>you\u2019re the only one with an alibi.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, on the second day, another murder is discovered in the mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While everyone fears a serial killer is among them, only <strong>you know the truth</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/b642e9ec2fcb553a0c62ce1974378748.webp?t=1749718499\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps you are the one closest to uncovering what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But is it worth the risk?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Is the truth ever worth that much?</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/9887f1ed290c17607806aba1ec882370.avif?t=1749718499\" data-has-big width=800 height=921 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YORAM</strong> is a mystery visual novel set in Victorian London.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the mind of Irene Lindbergh\u2014a disgraced writer who has committed a hidden crime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a second, unexplained murder rocks the estate, she must navigate suspicion, lies, and buried family secrets to uncover the truth\u2014 all while keeping her own guilt buried.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take your time with the story <strong>YORAM</strong> has to tell.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no need to rush. <br>Savor a tale that unfolds slowly\u2014but inevitably\u2014against a backdrop of elegantly drawn characters and richly detailed scenery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/a468aa63a33eb0f5dc59f8c3e17967a1.poster.avif?t=1749718499\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/a468aa63a33eb0f5dc59f8c3e17967a1.webm?t=1749718499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/a468aa63a33eb0f5dc59f8c3e17967a1.mp4?t=1749718499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're given the freedom to move, wander the mansion. <br>Talk to the people within its walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover what drives them. <br>What binds them. <br>What they long for\u2014 <br>and what might break them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/e4a753bbbb654b34280d09ada0979bc6.poster.avif?t=1749718499\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/e4a753bbbb654b34280d09ada0979bc6.webm?t=1749718499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/e4a753bbbb654b34280d09ada0979bc6.mp4?t=1749718499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you see, hear, and investigate is recorded automatically in your notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold onto that information. <br>You\u2019ll need it\u2014when the moment of crisis finally arrives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when that moment does come\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/f9505db83e0025281ec2e332c99b3745.poster.avif?t=1749718499\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/f9505db83e0025281ec2e332c99b3745.webm?t=1749718499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/f9505db83e0025281ec2e332c99b3745.mp4?t=1749718499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By any means necessary. <br>Even if it means hurting someone. <br>Even if it means lying. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Even if it means crushing the truth beneath your feet-.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/839f6d83af0307758884f45d18052df3.avif?t=1749718499\" data-has-big width=800 height=6452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/aadc5f3e1db62280a64fef649a4d96c1.webp?t=1749718499\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Irene Lindbergh, a young writer disowned by her own family.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your father, once the most prominent businessman in London, died in a tragic accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, under a torrential rain, the heirs of the family gather at the estate, each with their eyes on the vast inheritance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/5f7641d7f786c7b2375ff32c5cd8d34b.webp?t=1749718499\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutting words and old grudges wound you deeply as you navigate the toxic web of family ties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Was it the pain that ran too deep? Or merely a mistake? <br>In a moment you can\u2019t take back, you commit a murder <br>\u2014though, perhaps\u2026 it wasn\u2019t so accidental after all.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/c50adc44085d01c17d9af6e00d9c1860.webp?t=1749718499\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\