ts to uncover the truth\u2014 all while keeping her own guilt buried.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take your time with the story <strong>YORAM</strong> has to tell.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no need to rush. <br>Savor a tale that unfolds slowly\u2014but inevitably\u2014against a backdrop of elegantly drawn characters and richly detailed scenery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/a468aa63a33eb0f5dc59f8c3e17967a1.poster.avif?t=1749718499\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/a468aa63a33eb0f5dc59f8c3e17967a1.webm?t=1749718499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/a468aa63a33eb0f5dc59f8c3e17967a1.mp4?t=1749718499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're given the freedom to move, wander the mansion. <br>Talk to the people within its walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover what drives them. <br>What binds them. <br>What they long for\u2014 <br>and what might break them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/e4a753bbbb654b34280d09ada0979bc6.poster.avif?t=1749718499\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/e4a753bbbb654b34280d09ada0979bc6.webm?t=1749718499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/e4a753bbbb654b34280d09ada0979bc6.mp4?t=1749718499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you see, hear, and investigate is recorded automatically in your notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold onto that information. <br>You\u2019ll need it\u2014when the moment of crisis finally arrives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when that moment does come\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/f9505db83e0025281ec2e332c99b3745.poster.avif?t=1749718499\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/f9505db83e0025281ec2e332c99b3745.webm?t=1749718499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632370/extras/f9505db83e0025281ec2e332c99b3745.mp4?t=1749718499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By any means necessary. <br>Even if it means hurting someone. <br>Even if it means lying. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Even if it means crushing the truth beneath your feet-.</strong></p>",
